Dear Professor Hu Junlin,

I hope this email finds you well.

My name is Muhammad Ilyas, and I am from Pakistan. I recently graduated with =
a Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from the University of Swat, Paki=
stan, with a CGPA of 3.25/4.00. I am writing to express my interest in pursui=
ng a Master's degree at Beihang University under your supervision through the=
 Chinese Government Scholarship (CSC) for the 2027 intake.

During my undergraduate studies, I gained knowledge and practical experience =
in software engineering, Python programming, database management, and web dev=
elopment. My final-year project, "Design and Development of Nova Store: A Web=
-Based E-Commerce Platform," helped me strengthen my technical and problem-so=
lving skills. I also worked as a Full-Stack Developer at Vertex Software Tech=
nology Park, where I gained professional experience in Python, Django, React.=
js, and database systems.

I am particularly interested in Computer Vision. I would be grateful for the =
opportunity to develop my research skills and contribute to academic research=
 under your guidance at Beihang University.

I would sincerely appreciate it if you could consider me as a prospective Mas=
ter's student under your supervision and, if possible, provide an acceptance =
letter to support my CSC scholarship application.

I have attached my CV for your review. Thank you very much for your valuable =
time and consideration. I look forward to your positive response.

Best regards,

Muhammad Ilyas =20
BS Software Engineering =20
University of Swat, Pakistan =20
